cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "California crash data: surface-street junctions and county totals, 2023-2025"
abstract: >-
  Surface-street road pairings across California ranked by crashes reported to
  the California Crash Reporting System, and statewide crash totals by county
  and year, for 2023 to 2025. Compiled from public-domain CCRS exports
  published by the California Highway Patrol. No figure is modelled or
  estimated.
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
